[{"type":"message","user":"U01DE459A02","text":"\u003c@U01DE459A02\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628950584.037500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"1386c472-ea73-47aa-9bd4-b81ad9bbebfb","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"自分の仕事に関わってくるなら、他分野でも勉強した方が良いし、しなければならないって場面は本当あるあるですねぇ\nだから本当この仕事は勉強することが多い","ts":"1628921671.037100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=9/M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FAA05E0D-6B0C-41BA-BAEE-FCD84C2DA902","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"（と言っとけば角が立たないかもしれない（本質はまったく同じ","ts":"1628915787.034800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XCnI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1D3D22C1-E166-4888-97E0-545F27C454B6","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"技術観点のあるデザイナーさんは神。","ts":"1628915667.033900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","UD1FQV38V","U01J7703PFT","U776661HA"]},{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qbVX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4A0F4EB4-863C-4523-BD4E-B12E94DC06DD","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"でも、ウェブやアプリなどのITに関わるデザインに携わるなら、ちゃんと勉強しないとね。逆にフロントの開発する人もデザインの勉強しないといけないと思う","ts":"1628915192.033100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":3,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U776661HA","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7set"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CFF11F85-1BAA-42B1-A1B2-58B76BC8C32A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"自分でデザインをやって思ったのは、デザイナーさんが〇〇できますか？っていう質問のほとんどは正直不勉強のせいですね（ツイートすると炎上する発言","ts":"1628915066.030300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HGf6u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"734cdf02-0329-4d17-a3e3-ca3781763c37","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"業務ならできないことをできると言ったらまずいので、それをちゃんと調べるといつの間にか出来上がってることも稀によくあり。。\n\n向こうがいつまでに返答が欲しいのかはちゃんと聞いとく必要がありますね。それによってやることが変わってくる","ts":"1628914748.027900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kGl1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e218b112-174f-436c-ac7f-51618a6c21e3","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まぁ業務で（非エンジニア職の方に）聞かれた時とエンジニア初心者の質問でまた変わってきますよね。","ts":"1628914383.026500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LHmB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"267f9625-8912-4ef5-b892-197afa176964","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"技術質問への回答はヒントに留めておいた方がいいみたいな言説をよく見るので貼るか迷うんですよね","ts":"1628913808.025500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8AFM3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4d26af1-bc37-4597-83f6-b0766d4f351d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003c#CJMV3MSLR|question\u003eで回答する前に検証していたりするけど恐らく質問者はこれが欲しいんだろうなという物が完成したりすることがある","ts":"1628913772.024300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r3HB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df591589-46df-4819-8b36-60ea2c02d838","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1426006224273698817\u003e\nわかる","ts":"1628913582.022800","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp|@mattn_jp\u003e: できるかどうかを正確に回答する為に、検証してみないと分からない事も稀にあり、検証しているうちに出来上がってしまったという事象はプログラマ界隈では(非常に)よく起きる事ですね。 \u003chttp://twitter.com/pokopen_cg/sta|twitter.com/pokopen_cg/sta\u003e…","id":1,"author_name":"mattn","author_subname":"@mattn_jp","author_link":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1426006224273698817","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1361128357698572292/61_qdnll_normal.jpg","text":"できるかどうかを正確に回答する為に、検証してみないと分からない事も稀にあり、検証しているうちに出来上がってしまったという事象はプログラマ界隈では(非常に)よく起きる事ですね。 \u003chttp://twitter.com/pokopen_cg/sta|twitter.com/pokopen_cg/sta\u003e…","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1628821352,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1426006224273698817","original_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1426006224273698817"},{"color":"32BBF3","fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/pokopen_cg|@pokopen_cg\u003e: プログラマにすごく気を遣うのが「◯◯ってできますかね？」みたいに質問した際に、しばらくして「実装しました」と実装して返事が返ってくる事が経験上多くて。","id":2,"author_name":"ぽこぺん","author_subname":"@pokopen_cg","author_link":"https://twitter.com/pokopen_cg/status/1425648585681510400","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1318939988466094083/69h87NBc_normal.jpg","text":"プログラマにすごく気を遣うのが「◯◯ってできますかね？」みたいに質問した際に、しばらくして「実装しました」と実装して返事が返ってくる事が経験上多くて。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1628736084,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/pokopen_cg/status/1425648585681510400"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Czj3"}]}]
